  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Library's c. 3 has special cover placed loosely about the vol. The upper board is covered in red plastic that extends to the midline of the spine, the lower is covered in light blue cloth. To the upper board has been affixed a U-shaped carraway seed roll painted blue, and to the lower another roll painted red. Signed in pencil on p. [3]: 85/100 Dieter Roth 73. A rubber band, now broken, has been placed in the vol.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Copies 1 and 2 consist of cropped sheets of Icelandic Christmas cards, postcards, and tourist brochures, with various overprintings, color separations and misregistrations. Copy 3 consists of leaves from Ur myndabok natturunnar / eftir Ingimar Oskarsson, and Safety instructions Super DC-8, both treated similarly.</subfield>
